# The same undirected walk as explore.keys, with an orc priest instead of an
# orc barbarian, and with spellcasting and prayer mixed in.
#
#   tools/headless.sh tools/keys/explore-priest.keys 1
#
# Why a second character: 200 sessions of one barbarian walk the same code.
# A priest reaches the spell system, the prayer system and the divine effects,
# which is where most of the ruleset that is declared but not implemented
# lives.
#
# Generated the same way as explore.keys, seeded 20260815.

